message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "DINEOF-HPC: a high-performance Python/Numba implementation of DINEOF with space-time Barnes residual refinement"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-09
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24083994
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/Julien-res/dineof_hpc"
abstract: >-
  Python/Numba implementation of Data Interpolating Empirical Orthogonal Functions (DINEOF)
  for large satellite ocean-colour datasets, with cross-validation on isolated points,
  optimal-interpolation error estimates and space-time Barnes residual refinement.
keywords:
  - DINEOF
  - EOF
  - gap filling
  - ocean colour
  - satellite
  - Numba
  - Python
